  {
   "idx": 2,
   "zh": "中共中央总书记、国家主席、中央军委主席习近平近日作出重要指示强调，树立和践行正确政绩观是一项长期任务，必须久久为功，不断巩固拓展学习教育成果，持续推动各级党组织和广大党员、干部立党为公、为民造福、科学决策、真抓实干，以实际行动赢得人民群众信任。",
   "en": "While urging constantly consolidating and expanding the progress made in the campaign, Xi, also Chinese president and chairman of the Central Military Commission, said it is necessary to continue the persistent efforts and the ongoing progress made in the campaign, and to constantly encourage Party organizations at all levels and Party members and officials to serve the public, deliver benefits to the people, make decisions scientifically, and carry out real work, so as to win the trust of the people through concrete actions.",
   "kind": "para",
