  {
   "idx": 3,
   "zh": "习近平指出，党的十八大以来，针对一个时期党的建设中的重要问题、紧迫问题，在全党组织开展学习教育活动，已经成为党的建设一项重要制度性安排。这次树立和践行正确政绩观学习教育在党中央坚强领导下，坚持把理论学习贯穿始终，真查实改政绩观偏差问题，着眼健全制度、改进作风、推动工作，取得明显成效。",
   "en": "Since the 18th CPC National Congress, Party-wide study and education campaigns on major and pressing issues in Party building have become a major institutional arrangement for Party building. The recent study and education campaign on developing and practicing a correct view of governance performance was held under the strong leadership of the CPC Central Committee, with theoretical study running through the entire process, investigation and rectification of problems in governance performance, and a focus on improving institutions, work styles and work performance, achieving notable results.",
   "kind": "para",
