   ]
  },
  {
   "idx": 4,
   "zh": "习近平强调，要经常性开展政绩观教育，重点抓好对地方党政正职、新提拔干部、年轻干部、关键岗位干部的教育培训，强化示范引领和反面警示，引导党员、干部始终以正确政绩观担当作为、履职尽责。",
   "en": "Xi underlined the need to conduct regular education on the view of governance performance, with a focus on education and training for the primary leading officials of local Party committees and governments, newly promoted officials, young officials, and officials in key positions, to strengthen role modeling and warnings by negative examples, and guide Party members and officials to always act with a correct view of governance performance and fulfill their responsibilities.",
   "kind": "para",
