    8
   ]
  },
  {
   "idx": 5,
   "zh": "要坚持常态化查改问题，对需要长期整改的政绩观偏差突出问题盯紧盯牢、一抓到底，深入剖析根源、着力建章立制，切实做到整改不到位不放过、群众不满意不放过。",
   "en": "Xi noted that it is imperative to maintain a routine approach to identifying and rectifying problems. For prominent issues of deviations in the view of governance performance that require long-term rectification, it is essential to keep a close eye on them and see the rectification through to the end, deeply analyze the root causes, and establish sound institutions to ensure that no rectification is considered complete until it is thorough and satisfactory to the people.",
