   "en": "It was stressed at the meeting that Xi's important instructions have fully affirmed the work and outcomes of the Party-wide study and education campaign, and set out clear requirements for consolidating and expanding the results and establishing a long-term mechanism. The whole Party must study and fully understand these instructions and implement them thoroughly.",
