   "en": "It was pointed out at the meeting that this particular study and education campaign has basically concluded. Under the strong leadership of the CPC Central Committee with Comrade Xi Jinping at its core, Party organizations at all levels shouldered their responsibilities and advanced study, investigation and rectification in an integrated manner, deepening Party members' and officials' understanding of the correct view of governance performance, effectively resolving a number of prominent problems stemming from deviations, and tangibly strengthening Party spirit cultivation.",
