   "en": "Yet the study and education campaign is a new starting point rather than a simple finish line, the meeting stressed. Efforts should be made to continually strengthen the theoretical arming of the Party with its innovative theories, thoroughly study and implement Xi Jinping Thought on Party Building and the guiding principles of Xi's important instructions, consolidate and expand the results, and establish a long-term mechanism.",
